#: ../src/avatar.c:423
#, fuzzy, c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Usage: %s avatar [OPTIONS]... [NAME|EMAIL|KEYID|U4|U5]\n"
#| "\n"
#| "Extract or add image inside OpenPGP certificate.\n"
#| "Missing NAME|EMAIL|KEYID|U4|U5 => the first secret certificate.\n"
#| "Writing takes a fingerprint and nothing else: revoking cannot be\n"
#| "undone, so a search must never become a target.\n"
#| "New IMAGE should be 180x180 pixels, or it will be resized.\n"
#| "Output the path of the image that stands today, newest first when several do.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "OPTIONS:\n"
#| "  -E, --extract-all           Output every image, revoked and expired ones included, newest first\n"
#| "  -A, --replace-to IMAGE      Resize and add new IMAGE inside OpenPGP certificate (revoking any previous image)\n"
#| "  -R, --revoke                Just revoke all existing images inside OpenPGP certificate\n"
#| "  -W, --workdir DIRECTORY     Working directory. Will contain previous and new resized images\n"
#| "  -K, --keyservers KEYSERVERS If non-empty, send updated certificate to this keyservers - Default: %s\n"
#| "  -h, --help                  Print this help and exit\n"
#| "  -V, --version               Print the version and exit\n"
msgid ""
"Usage: %s cert_avatar [OPTIONS]... [NAME|EMAIL|KEYID|U4|U5]\n"
"\n"
"Extract or add image inside PGP certificate.\n"
"Missing NAME|EMAIL|KEYID|U4|U5 => the first secret certificate.\n"
"Writing takes a fingerprint and nothing else: revoking cannot be\n"
"undone, so a search must never become a target.\n"
"New IMAGE should be 180x180 pixels, or it will be resized.\n"
"Output the path of the image that stands today, newest first when several do.\n"
"\n"
"OPTIONS:\n"
"  -E, --extract-all           Output every image, revoked and expired ones included, newest first\n"
"  -A, --replace-to IMAGE      Resize and add new IMAGE inside PGP certificate (revoking any previous image)\n"
"  -R, --revoke                Just revoke all existing images inside PGP certificate\n"
"  -W, --workdir DIRECTORY     Working directory. Will contain previous and new resized images\n"
"  -K, --keyservers KEYSERVERS If non-empty, send updated certificate to this keyservers - Default: %s\n"
"  -h, --help                  Print this help and exit\n"
"  -V, --version               Print the version and exit\n"
msgstr ""
"Usage: %s avatar [OPTIONS]... [NOME|INDIRIZZO|KEYID|U4|U5]\n"
"\n"
"Estrarre o aggiungere un'immagine nel certificato OpenPGP.\n"
"NOME|INDIRIZZO|KEYID|U4|U5 mancante ⇒ il primo certificato segreto.\n"
"Scrivere richiede un'impronta e nient'altro: revocare non si disfa, e una\n"
"ricerca non deve mai diventare un bersaglio.\n"
"La nuova IMMAGINE dev'essere 180×180 pixel, altrimenti sarà ridimensionata.\n"
"Stampa il percorso dell'immagine che vale oggi, la più recente per prima.\n"
"\n"
"OPTIONS:\n"
"  -E, --extract-all           Stampare ogni immagine, revocate e scadute comprese, la più recente per prima\n"
"  -A, --replace-to IMMAGINE   Ridimensionare e aggiungere IMMAGINE nel certificato (revocando le precedenti)\n"
"  -R, --revoke                Revocare soltanto tutte le immagini esistenti nel certificato OpenPGP\n"
"  -W, --workdir DIRECTORY     Directory di lavoro. Conterrà le immagini precedenti e le nuove ridimensionate\n"
"  -K, --keyservers SERVER     Se non vuoto, inviare il certificato aggiornato a questi server - Default: %s\n"
"  -h, --help                  Stampare questo aiuto e uscire\n"
"  -V, --version               Stampare la versione e uscire\n"
"\n"

